OL,3,GNEWSAMan begins 100-mile run for
OL,4,Ameningitis charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is hoping his 100-mile charity
OL,7,Frun will spur more students to be
OL,8,Fvaccinated against meningitis B
OL,9,Ffollowing the death of his friend.
OL,11,FShaun McEntee, who only completed his
OL,12,Ffirst half marathon last year, is
OL,13,Frunning from Kidderminster Harriers
OL,14,FFC's Aggborough Stadium to Anfield,
OL,15,Fhome of Liverpool FC.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
