OL,3,GNEWSAMan begins 100-mile run for
OL,4,Ameningitis charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe hopes to raise #5,000 for Meningitis
OL,7,FNow following the death of family
OL,8,Ffriend and Liverpool fan Aaron Mills,
OL,9,Fwho died from meningitis in January in
OL,10,FKidderminster during a break from his
OL,11,Fstudies at Liverpool John Moores
OL,12,FUniversity.
OL,14,F"I'll get through one way or another,"
OL,15,Fsaid McEntee, who set off earlier.
OL,16,F"There's too much support, there's too
OL,17,Fmany people that I'd be letting down if
OL,18,FI [don't]."
